    { "f": 39.800, "n": "CHP — Golden Gate Division (low band)", "z": "加州公路巡警金门分局（低波段）", "c": "safety", "m": "NFM", "conf": "check", "a": "California Highway Patrol", "d": "The CHP still runs analog low-band VHF around 39.2–39.9 MHz, which propagates remarkably far and is fully receivable on the VX-6. Exact dispatch channel varies by division — scan the whole 39 MHz block along any freeway.", "dz": "加州公路巡警仍在 39.2–39.9 MHz 使用模拟低波段，传播距离很远，VX-6 完全可收。各分局的调度频率不同——沿高速把整个 39 MHz 段扫一遍。", "odds": 2 },
