    { "f": 0, "n": "SF Police & Fire — P25 digital", "z": "旧金山警消 · P25 数字", "c": "safety", "m": "P25", "dig": true, "conf": "high", "a": "Not receivable", "d": "San Francisco, Oakland and San Jose have all migrated to encrypted or digital P25 trunked systems in the 700/800 MHz band. The VX-6 is an analog-only receiver and cannot decode these. A separate digital scanner is required.", "dz": "旧金山、奥克兰、圣何塞均已迁移到 700/800 MHz 的加密或 P25 数字集群系统。VX-6 只能收模拟，无法解码，需要另配数字扫描机。" },

